      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T04:36:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Addressed in patch set 4: a pending BootMode mismatch now clears the iDRAC job queue once and retries, and a set failure does the same through _apply_bootmode_with_retry. Tests cover a conflicting pending value that clears successfully and a set failure that succeeds on retry.",
